@* Blazor's event-handler attributes (@onclick and friends) are defined here. Without this a
   component's @onclick compiles to an ordinary attribute and silently wires nothing: the button
   renders, the cursor changes, and clicking does absolutely nothing. IssueRoadmap and
   LogSearchView both shipped that way, which is what this import exists to stop. *@
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
@using Radzen
@using Radzen.Blazor
@using Tharga.Blazor
@using Tharga.Blazor.Framework.Buttons